  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Calculates approximated speculars based on SH data and some PBR
    inputs.


    Can''t calculate individual speculars and can cause speculars bleeding.
    Recommended for simple prop/avatar shades where speculars accuracy is not that
    important.


    Also it''s the onlu way to recover speculars from Volumes.


    For
    better speculars from Point Light Volumes,  it''s recommended to use the LightVolumeSHSpecular
    node!'
